WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.591 --> 00:00:06.662
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

00:00:06.962 --> 00:00:08.964
Wait, this isn't gonna work.

00:00:08.964 --> 00:00:12.535
If a rescue team comes, that gun's
gonna turn them into peppered steak.

00:00:12.535 --> 00:00:13.602
[scientist sneezes]

00:00:13.602 --> 00:00:14.603
Good idea.

00:00:14.603 --> 00:00:15.538
[whistling noise]
Yep.

00:00:15.538 --> 00:00:16.505
[turret firing]

00:00:16.505 --> 00:00:17.440
[turret beeps]
You're right.

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:18.441
[turret beeps]
There's a firing delay

00:00:18.441 --> 00:00:19.875
[turret beeps]
when it's not beeping.

00:00:19.875 --> 00:00:21.811
[turret beeps]
And there's another bug!

00:00:21.811 --> 00:00:22.611
[turret beeps]

00:00:22.611 --> 00:00:23.913
[turret beeps]
Damn, these things are faster

00:00:23.913 --> 00:00:25.715
[turret beeps]
than the centipedes in my house!

00:00:25.715 --> 00:00:26.282
[turret beeps]

00:00:26.282 --> 00:00:27.416
[turret beeps]
Eh, screw it.

00:00:27.416 --> 00:00:28.984
[turret beeps]
I'll just wait until the beeping stops,

00:00:28.984 --> 00:00:30.352
[turret beeps]
then make a dash for it.

00:00:30.352 --> 00:00:31.253
[turret beeps]

00:00:31.253 --> 00:00:32.455
[turret beeps]
It's just as well.

00:00:32.455 --> 00:00:34.023
[turret deactivating]
I wasn't looking forward to staying here

00:00:34.023 --> 00:00:35.925
and cannibalizing that guy for food.

00:00:36.559 --> 00:00:38.360
Oh, back for more, huh?

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:41.297
SCIENTIST: Don't you think we
should...wait here for a while?

00:00:41.297 --> 00:00:42.965
Nah, you're on your own, chump.

00:00:43.833 --> 00:00:45.568
[whistling sound]
Pew!

00:00:45.568 --> 00:00:46.836
[turret beeps]
Sweet!

00:00:46.836 --> 00:00:49.472
[turret beeps]
Man, that guy back there is just screwed.

00:00:49.472 --> 00:00:51.674
[turret beeps]
Well, once again, not my problem.

00:00:51.674 --> 00:00:52.274
[turret beeps]
Oh, what the--

00:00:52.274 --> 00:00:53.175
[headcrab squeals]

00:00:53.175 --> 00:00:55.644
OKAY, CHILDREN, CLASS IS IN SESSION!

00:00:55.644 --> 00:00:57.279
EVERYONE TAKE YOUR SEATS!

00:00:57.279 --> 00:01:00.015
I SAID, "EVERYONE TAKE YOUR SEATS!"

00:01:00.015 --> 00:01:01.951
DAMMIT, BILLY, THAT MEANS YOU, TOO!

00:01:01.951 --> 00:01:03.853
TAKE YOUR SEAT!

00:01:03.853 --> 00:01:07.223
Okay, now today's lesson is
on--wait, what am I doing?

00:01:07.223 --> 00:01:08.290
I don't know.

00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:12.228
Y'know, facial lacerations aside,
that was pretty pimp of me.

00:01:12.228 --> 00:01:13.596
[gunfire]
I need a sword.

00:01:13.596 --> 00:01:14.964
And a helmet.

00:01:14.964 --> 00:01:16.332
And a horse.

00:01:16.332 --> 00:01:16.866
Yeah.

00:01:17.466 --> 00:01:18.868
Hey, can I have your gun?

00:01:18.868 --> 00:01:20.936
I thought it'd be cool to shoot
people with two pistols

00:01:20.936 --> 00:01:23.005
like I'm in a John Woo movie or something.

00:01:24.507 --> 00:01:25.074
Uhh...

00:01:25.674 --> 00:01:28.410
Fine, don't say anything, ya freak.

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:30.880
Oh, I guess he was using it.

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:35.417
Still, one gun is fun,
but two is Woo-tastic.

00:01:35.417 --> 00:01:36.152
[ceiling tiles fall]
What?

00:01:36.152 --> 00:01:37.520
[headcrab squeals]
Gah!  Dammit!

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:40.890
I'm getting sick of these face-huggers
trying to French me.

00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:43.225
It's not like I'm that hard up.
Christ.

00:01:44.059 --> 00:01:45.227
Oh, what's this?

00:01:45.895 --> 00:01:47.897
Oh, doing the vent thing, huh?

00:01:47.897 --> 00:01:48.898
Yeah, I was--

00:01:48.898 --> 00:01:52.067
[alien growls, scientists scream]

00:01:52.067 --> 00:01:54.236
Ugh!  You dumbasses!

00:01:54.236 --> 00:01:56.539
You can't go through the fan blades!

00:01:56.539 --> 00:01:59.341
Some people just have to
learn things the hard way.

00:01:59.341 --> 00:02:02.711
I mean, it only took me one time to
learn not to stick your head in a fan.

00:02:02.711 --> 00:02:04.079
[vortigaunt charging up]
Oh no...

00:02:04.079 --> 00:02:05.014
[vortigaunt bolt]
DAAAH!

00:02:05.014 --> 00:02:06.348
Quit zapping me!

00:02:06.348 --> 00:02:07.817
Let's see how you like it!

00:02:07.817 --> 00:02:08.317
Dammit!

00:02:08.651 --> 00:02:09.852
Have to reload...

00:02:10.085 --> 00:02:11.153
Okay, pumpkinhead.

00:02:11.153 --> 00:02:11.987
[vortigese]

00:02:12.555 --> 00:02:15.257
Gah!  These aliens suck!

00:02:15.257 --> 00:02:18.694
I'm already afraid of Muppets;
I don't need this on top of that!

00:02:19.195 --> 00:02:20.362
Come out!

00:02:20.362 --> 00:02:21.197
[whistles]

00:02:21.764 --> 00:02:23.199
They're not coming.

00:02:23.199 --> 00:02:26.001
You guys are even worse than the
face-huggers, you know that?

00:02:26.001 --> 00:02:27.303
I need a name for you.

00:02:27.303 --> 00:02:30.472
I'm just going to call you 'zappers'
until I can think of something better.

00:02:30.472 --> 00:02:31.674
Where the hell are they?

00:02:31.674 --> 00:02:32.675
[vortigese]

00:02:32.675 --> 00:02:34.476
[vortigese]
Oh, I can hear them.

00:02:34.476 --> 00:02:35.678
I'd better check my flank.

00:02:35.678 --> 00:02:37.680
That's how they got
that dude in Jurassic Park.

00:02:38.547 --> 00:02:40.382
Oh, wait, those were raptors.

00:02:40.850 --> 00:02:42.151
Well, I'd shoot them, too.

00:02:42.151 --> 00:02:43.018
[vortigaunt charging up]

00:02:43.018 --> 00:02:43.485
[vortigaunt charging up]
Bastard!

00:02:43.485 --> 00:02:44.420
[vortigaunt bolt]
[shudders]

00:02:45.287 --> 00:02:47.323
THAT'S SO FRIGGIN' ANNOYING!

00:02:47.323 --> 00:02:50.693
It's not like the electricity
kills me; it just hurts!

00:02:50.693 --> 00:02:52.294
I'm not sure what I'm more upset about:

00:02:52.294 --> 00:02:53.596
that they're shocking me,

00:02:53.596 --> 00:02:56.398
or that I can't shoot
electricity from my hands.

00:02:56.966 --> 00:02:58.667
I'm going backwards again, aren't I?

00:02:58.667 --> 00:03:00.035
[vortigese]

00:03:00.035 --> 00:03:01.337
Boom!

00:03:01.337 --> 00:03:02.972
Oh, I see you, too!

00:03:03.606 --> 00:03:06.809
Oh, man!  I shoot one
long-distance through a window

00:03:06.809 --> 00:03:09.144
and another one that's
waiting to jump me!

00:03:09.144 --> 00:03:12.314
That is James Bond intuition!

00:03:12.314 --> 00:03:13.883
Damn, I'm awesome!

00:03:13.883 --> 00:03:18.787
[hums James Bond theme]

00:03:18.787 --> 00:03:19.521
[hums James Bond theme]
[ceiling tiles fall]

00:03:19.521 --> 00:03:21.991
[hums James Bond theme]
Dooh-duh-DAH-DAH! Duh, dehduh!

00:03:21.991 --> 00:03:23.726
How did that thing know I was here?

00:03:23.726 --> 00:03:25.427
How many of you fuckers are
there?

00:03:25.427 --> 00:03:28.831
Do you want me to individually engrave
your names on each of my bullets?

00:03:28.831 --> 00:03:31.267
Is my gun not personal enough for you?

00:03:31.267 --> 00:03:33.802
I'll kill every last one of you bastards.

00:03:33.802 --> 00:03:35.337
All I need are bullets.

00:03:35.337 --> 00:03:37.039
We have a lot of bullets here!

00:03:38.374 --> 00:03:41.277
EARTH IS A MINERAL-RICH PLANET!

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:43.112
I BET YOURS SUCKS!

00:03:43.112 --> 00:03:45.748
It's probably a swamp
planet with no metal!

00:03:45.748 --> 00:03:48.284
And, if it's not, you probably
belong in a swamp, anyway!

00:03:48.284 --> 00:03:50.753
You should be out killing
vacationing college students,

00:03:50.753 --> 00:03:52.621
not scientists trying to get
work do--

00:03:52.621 --> 00:03:53.555
[gagging]

00:03:53.555 --> 00:03:54.356
[barnacle chirping]
[gagging]

00:03:56.125 --> 00:03:57.293
What the fuck?!

00:03:57.293 --> 00:03:59.094
Now, I'm covered in blood!

00:03:59.094 --> 00:04:00.095
In my hair...

00:04:00.095 --> 00:04:02.498
This is going to jam my gun.

00:04:02.498 --> 00:04:03.632
And, what about you?

00:04:03.632 --> 00:04:04.833
Enjoying the show?

00:04:04.833 --> 00:04:07.503
SCIENTIST: I just overheard the
secure access transmission.

00:04:07.503 --> 00:04:10.472
SCIENTIST: Soldiers have arrived
and they're coming to rescue us.

00:04:10.472 --> 00:04:13.409
SCIENTIST: Of course, I have my doubts
that we'll live long enough to greet them.

00:04:13.409 --> 00:04:15.511
YEAH, THANKS FOR THE WARNING, ASSHOLE!

00:04:15.511 --> 00:04:17.947
I REALLY APPRECIATE HOW YOU
STOOD THERE STARING AT ME

00:04:17.947 --> 00:04:19.782
AND NOT DOING A GOD DAMNED THING!

00:04:19.782 --> 00:04:22.685
YOU'RE LIKE A CAT WATCHING A MOUSE DIE!

00:04:22.685 --> 00:04:25.287
I'm getting out of here.
There's too many psychos in this place.

00:04:25.287 --> 00:04:25.888
[whistling sound]

00:04:25.888 --> 00:04:26.689
[whistling sound]
What's that noise?

00:04:26.689 --> 00:04:27.489
[turret firing]

00:04:27.489 --> 00:04:28.490
[turret firing]
WAAAH!

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:29.692
[turret firing]
MY EAR!

00:04:29.692 --> 00:04:31.961
[turret beeping]
I GOT SHOT IN THE EAR!

00:04:31.961 --> 00:04:34.763
[turret beeping]
WHY IS THE BUILDING TRYING TO
KILL ME?!

00:04:34.763 --> 00:04:36.065
[turret beeping]
I'M AN EMPLOYEE!

00:04:36.065 --> 00:04:38.534
[turret beeping]
YOU DON'T SHOOT YOUR EMPLOYEES!

00:04:38.534 --> 00:04:39.668
[turret beeping]

00:04:39.668 --> 00:04:41.337
[turret beeping]
You are NOT employees!

00:04:41.337 --> 00:04:43.238
[turret beeping]

00:04:43.238 --> 00:04:44.974
[turret beeping]
DAMMIT!

00:04:44.974 --> 00:04:46.508
[turret beeping]
YOU'RE ALL FIRED!

00:04:46.508 --> 00:04:47.710
[turret beeping]

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:49.311
[turret firing]
NO!

00:04:49.311 --> 00:04:50.346
[turret beeping]
Fuck this.

00:04:50.346 --> 00:04:52.281
[turret beeping]
I'm going to wait for that thing
to power down.

00:04:52.281 --> 00:04:59.922
[turret beeping, whistling in time]

00:04:59.922 --> 00:05:03.092
[turret beeping]
I can't believe that we have
automatic turret guns.

00:05:03.092 --> 00:05:05.361
[turret beeping]
You shouldn't kill your workers.

00:05:05.361 --> 00:05:08.630
[turret deactivating]
I thought they taught that in, 
like, Business 101.

00:05:08.630 --> 00:05:09.565
Okay...

00:05:09.565 --> 00:05:11.100
[imitating Bionic Man sound]

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:12.935
Man, I just don't get a break.

00:05:14.536 --> 00:05:18.073
Kneel before me!  Ha ha ha ha ha ha....

00:05:18.073 --> 00:05:20.542
Hah, no smoking around the turret gun.

00:05:20.542 --> 00:05:22.011
Bad for your health.

00:05:22.011 --> 00:05:22.911
[vortigese]
Oh, oh!

00:05:25.347 --> 00:05:27.516
Yeah, keep on gargling; I'm reloading.

00:05:28.650 --> 00:05:31.120
And that's why you should stay in school.

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:34.289
Man, I am not happy at all about
getting my ear shot.

00:05:34.289 --> 00:05:36.759
I guess it's a free piercing,
but I don't have a mirror.

00:05:36.759 --> 00:05:38.293
I don't want to look like I'm gay.

00:05:38.293 --> 00:05:40.829
I guess gay is when you
get both ears pierced.

00:05:40.829 --> 00:05:42.131
Either that, or you're a sailor.

00:05:42.131 --> 00:05:43.499
GUARD: Are you thinking what I'm thinking?

00:05:43.499 --> 00:05:44.767
Who the hell are you talking to?

00:05:45.934 --> 00:05:47.036
Friggin' lunatic.

00:05:47.036 --> 00:05:50.105
GUARD: Hey, what the hell are you doing
down here?  Get topside!

00:05:50.105 --> 00:05:51.874
GUARD: I hear troops are
coming in to save us.

00:05:51.874 --> 00:05:53.609
Well, they're not coming fast enough!

00:05:53.609 --> 00:05:55.244
I got shot, y'know?

00:05:55.244 --> 00:05:57.146
Ah, first aid.  Yeah.

00:05:57.146 --> 00:05:58.680
I need some gauze.

00:05:59.314 --> 00:06:00.616
GUARD: I'll bet that stings a bit.

00:06:00.616 --> 00:06:04.586
Yeah, no shit, Skippy.  I've got more
blood on me than an ax murderer.

00:06:04.586 --> 00:06:07.689
I'd be arrested if I were to
approach a child looking like this.

00:06:08.524 --> 00:06:10.592
I wonder if there's
any more clips in here.

00:06:10.592 --> 00:06:12.227
I'm on my last one.

00:06:12.227 --> 00:06:15.697
I really wasn't expecting to use up
all my ammo, but what can I say?

00:06:15.697 --> 00:06:18.534
This gun keeps solving my
problems for me.

00:06:18.534 --> 00:06:22.538
Oh!  An exit sign!

00:06:22.538 --> 00:06:24.440
It's about bloody time.

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:25.340
[lock jiggles]

00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:27.042
Okay, remain calm.

00:06:27.910 --> 00:06:28.811
Jesus!

00:06:29.344 --> 00:06:31.413
Okay, we'll take this to the next level.

00:06:32.147 --> 00:06:33.615
What the fuck?!

00:06:33.615 --> 00:06:37.152
We installed bullet-proof
glass on our exit doors?

00:06:37.152 --> 00:06:38.720
That stuff's not cheap.

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:40.456
How retarded are we?

00:06:40.456 --> 00:06:42.191
[lock jiggles]
I don't know anymore.

00:06:42.191 --> 00:06:42.991
[lock jiggles]

00:06:42.991 --> 00:06:45.627
Ugh.  What did they think
was going to happen?

00:06:45.627 --> 00:06:49.465
The turret guns were going to sprout
a pair of legs and get up and leave?

00:06:49.465 --> 00:06:51.333
I'm just a rat in a maze.

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:53.368
With no cheese.

00:06:53.368 --> 00:06:54.670
And you're not helping.

00:06:57.473 --> 00:06:59.808
I guess I am getting a
gun out of the whole deal.

00:06:59.808 --> 00:07:02.911
That's registered in someone else's name!

00:07:02.911 --> 00:07:04.746
That means, once all this blows over,

00:07:04.746 --> 00:07:08.117
I'll be able to kill anyone and
get away with it if I want to.

00:07:08.117 --> 00:07:09.952
Hey, I think that's an exit.

00:07:09.952 --> 00:07:11.120
[ceiling tiles fall]
Huh?

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:12.121
[headcrabs chirp]
Oh my God!

00:07:12.121 --> 00:07:13.956
THIS WAS NOT APPROVED BY THE COMMITTEE!

00:07:13.956 --> 00:07:15.958
I'M NOT TAKING ANY QUESTIONS!

00:07:15.958 --> 00:07:16.792
NO COMMENT!

00:07:17.059 --> 00:07:17.893
NO COMMENT!

00:07:18.193 --> 00:07:19.128
NO COMMENT!

00:07:19.761 --> 00:07:23.065
Well, I can understand how some
people can't get enough of me,

00:07:23.065 --> 00:07:25.334
but it's for their own good, really.

00:07:26.502 --> 00:07:29.104
Yay, something I can actually break.

00:07:31.940 --> 00:07:34.776
God, my face must look like a
cutting board right now.

00:07:34.776 --> 00:07:36.245
I wonder if it'll scar.

00:07:36.245 --> 00:07:40.048
That would look badass if I had one
of those face scars across the eye.

00:07:40.048 --> 00:07:41.049
And my ear.

00:07:41.049 --> 00:07:42.851
Who else has pierced ears?

00:07:42.851 --> 00:07:43.619
Artists,

00:07:43.619 --> 00:07:44.853
punk rockers,

00:07:44.853 --> 00:07:45.888
pirates...

00:07:45.888 --> 00:07:47.890
Huh, pirates have both ears pierced.

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:49.625
But, then, they're sailors.

00:07:49.625 --> 00:07:50.792
Hey, is that coffee?

00:07:50.792 --> 00:07:52.261
Sweet, are there any doughnuts?

00:07:52.261 --> 00:07:54.530
Whoa!  That's a big no.

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:55.864
This isn't going to work.

00:07:58.433 --> 00:08:00.068
What the... they're deaf.

00:08:00.068 --> 00:08:01.270
They can't hear me.

00:08:01.270 --> 00:08:03.105
How the hell did they find me earlier?

00:08:03.105 --> 00:08:04.606
They don't have eyes.

00:08:04.606 --> 00:08:05.908
We may never know.

00:08:07.876 --> 00:08:09.811
Science will thank me someday.

00:08:09.811 --> 00:08:12.047
Alright, enough of this, I'm
getting some coffee.

00:08:12.648 --> 00:08:13.715
Now, which button?

00:08:18.387 --> 00:08:19.868
Yeah, that's the stuff.

